      "simplified": "小乐说：“保罗，中国的车太多，你骑摩托车要小心啊。”",
      "traditional": "小樂說：“保羅，中國的車太多，你騎摩托車要小心啊。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shuō bǎo luó zhōng guó de chē tài duō nǐ qí mó tuō chē yào xiǎo xīn a",
      "english": "One day, Paul had to take the motorcycle to go to work."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le said: “Paul, there are so many cars in China, you have to be careful when you ride the motorcycle.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "保罗笑着说：“没关系。我会戴安全套的。”",
      "traditional": "保羅笑著說：“沒關係。我會戴安全套的。”",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiào zhe shuō méi guān xi wǒ huì dài ān quán tào de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul laughed and said: “Don't worry, I will wear a condom.”"
    },
    {
