      "simplified": "小乐大笑，问：“你说什么？”",
      "traditional": "小樂大笑，問：“你說什麼？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè dà xiào wèn nǐ shuō shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le burst out laughing, and said: “What did you say?”"
